; kilim.http (design section 13): JSON, the decoders and the HTTP tasks above
; a transport record. It uses only the standard library and kilim, thus
; Http_mock of kilim.testing runs as native code. kilim.http.browser
; (browser/) gives the fetch transport. The rule of the banned modules of the
; core applies (test/link).

(library
 (name kilim_http)
 (public_name kilim.http)
 (flags
  (:standard -w +50))
 (libraries kilim)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
